---
description: Apply Websonette engineering and web-project boundaries.
alwaysApply: true
---

Follow Websonette Engineering Standards and the common standards in this plugin's `docs/standards/` directory.

Keep dependency direction `project -> adapter -> web-application`. Put framework-specific behavior in the selected adapter and business/design behavior in the consuming project. Apply SOLID, KISS, and DRY pragmatically. Prefer a direct, testable implementation; do not add speculative layers, interfaces, factories, managers, repositories, or generic frameworks.

Treat `websonette/web-application/contracts/` as the canonical cross-runtime serialization contract.
